### Create a product (seller or admin) — use category id(s) from above (e.g. 2)
POST {{url}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Summer Floral Dress",
  "description": "Lightweight summer dress with floral print",
  "price": 500,
  "images": ["uploads/dresses/red floral dress.jpg"
  , "uploads/dresses/white floral dress.jpg"],
  "category_ids": [2],
  "variants": [
    { "size": "S", "color": "Red", "stock": 10 },
    { "size": "M", "color": "White", "stock": 5 }
  ]
}

### Add another variant to product id 1 (admin or seller)
POST http://localhost:3000/products/1/variants
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "size": "L",
  "color": "Green",
  "stock": 7
}

### Public: list categories (no token needed)
GET {{url}}/categories

### Public: list products (no token needed)
GET {{url}}/products